schema: source-system
object:
  title: Metagov / Governance Research Network
  type: knowledge-garden
  steward: Metagov / Governance Research Network
  return_path: unset — establish via register-source
  url: https://metagov.org/
  what_it_curates: >-
    Metagov community and seminar; Govbase; PolicyKit; DAOstar and EIP-4824; KOI Pond; Interoperable Deliberative
    Tools; Polycentricity; D20 Governance; gov/acc; Metagov Journal; OSS Transitions; Groundwork Fellowship;
    MetagovDAO; Public AI and AI Renaissance.
  why_it_matters: >-
    A community of research and practice focused on tools, institutions, standards, datasets, experiments,
    and communities that enable self-governance in the digital age. It bridges governance research, online-community
    practice, civic and DAO tooling, field memory, and institutional experimentation.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: Canonical_DB.xlsx#Source-System Cards!row6
    source_lineage: https://metagov.org/
  caution: >-
    Metagov contains projects at different maturity states. A research prototype, seminar, dataset, standard,
    completed project, paused tool, or speculative governance experiment should not be treated as the
    same kind of evidence. Community participation and public archives also require privacy, consent,
    attribution, and status-sensitive interpretation.
